  "description": "This is the true story of Jun, who was born with autism in South Korea, a country that views disability with extreme suspicion. After years of trying to “cure” their son, his parents discovered his great passion for traditional music, and through his extraordinary talent, Jun will be able to fully express himself as he has never done before. \n\n*Note: The chapter count includes a prologue and epilogue.*",
